---
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/iceland_portrait.webp";
---

<section class="px-5 md:px-12 pt-16 md:pt-28">
  <SectionHeader id="about" index="04" title="ABOUT" />

  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] md:flex md:items-center md:gap-14">
    <div class="flex justify-center md:block md:w-[380px] lg:w-[420px] md:shrink-0">
      <div
        class="w-fit overflow-hidden border border-encore-line mb-3 mr-3 shadow-[8px_8px_0_0_theme(colors.encore.accent)] md:w-full"
      >
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="Adrian Cacho in Iceland"
          class="block max-h-[40vh] w-auto h-auto md:max-h-none md:w-full md:h-[560px] md:object-cover md:object-top md:aspect-square lg:aspect-auto"
          widths={[240, 390, 840]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 420px, 240px"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 text-center md:pt-0 md:text-left md:min-w-0 md:flex-1 md:max-w-[820px]">
      <p
        class="font-grotesk font-normal text-encore-fg text-base min-[1440px]:text-[17px] leading-[1.6] m-0"
      >
        I'm a Staff Full-Stack Engineer with over 10 years of experience building
        scalable, high-performance web applications and immersive experiences.
        I've led engineering teams to deliver high-impact products including <a
          href="https://blocks.glass"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-encore-accent no-underline hover:text-encore-fg transition-colors"
          >blocks.glass</a
        > — the first-ever content sharing platform for holograms, serving
        100,000+ digital assets — and Vertebrae, a 3D asset pipeline acquired by
        Snapchat.
      </p>

      <p
        class="font-grotesk font-normal text-encore-fg text-base min-[1440px]:text-[17px] leading-[1.6] m-0 pt-6"
      >
        My technical expertise spans full-stack development (React, TypeScript,
        Next.js, Node.js, PostgreSQL, AWS) and 3D web graphics (Three.js, WebGL).
        I've optimized complex database queries to achieve 70% performance
        improvements, architected payment systems processing thousands of
        transactions, and integrated AI/ML services using RAG techniques with
        LangChain. Most recently I've been working at the frontier of agentic AI
        — building MCP servers, agent tools, and the eval systems that measure
        them — as First Resonance's first AI engineer and on the agentic video
        editor at TwelveLabs. I combine strong engineering fundamentals with
        product thinking to deliver solutions that drive both user satisfaction
        and business outcomes.
      </p>

      <p
        class="font-grotesk font-normal text-encore-fg text-base min-[1440px]:text-[17px] leading-[1.6] m-0 pt-6"
      >
        Notable projects include building a Spotify app for Magic Leap using Unity
        and C++, developing mobile AR experiences for Coachella that reached
        millions of festival attendees, and completing the Polkadot Blockchain
        Academy to expand my expertise into Web3 and distributed systems using
        Rust and Substrate. As a visual artist, I also VJ major events using
        professional tools like Resolume, Disguise, and TouchDesigner, bringing a
        unique creative perspective to technical problem-solving.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
